# Applies to every build whose context is the repository root, which is how both
# images are built (docker build -f ingestion/Dockerfile .). It is what makes a
# leaked secret structural to prevent rather than a thing to remember.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*credentials*.json
**/service-account*.json
**/*-key.json
.venv
**/.venv
**/venv
.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
*.parquet
out/
**/.state/
**/target/
**/dbt_packages/
**/logs/
**/.user.yml
docs/
infra/
warehouse/
